{"meta":{"id":"bcrypt","category":"it/syntax/spring/security","title":"비밀번호 암호화 (BCrypt) · Spring","subtitle":"(SPRING)","summary":"BCryptPasswordEncoder bean 등록, encode 로 암호화, matches 로 비교","tags":["spring","보안"],"color":"rose","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-rose","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-rose-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-rose-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-rose-50 text-rose-700 border border-rose-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></span>SPRING</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">비밀번호 암호화 (BCrypt) · Spring</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-rose-50/70 border border-rose-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-rose-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> BCryptPasswordEncoder bean 등록, encode 로 암호화, matches 로 비교</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">BCryptPasswordEncoder</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">xml</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&lt;!-- servlet-context.xml : bean 등록 --&gt;\r\n&lt;beans:bean id=&quot;bCryptPasswordEncoder&quot;\r\n            class=&quot;org.springframework.security.crypto.bcrypt.BCryptPasswordEncoder&quot; /&gt;</pre></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">@Controller\r\npublic class HomeController {\r\n    @Autowired\r\n    BCryptPasswordEncoder passwordEncoder;\r\n\r\n    @RequestMapping(value = &quot;/pwdEnc&quot;, method = RequestMethod.GET)\r\n    public String pwdEnc(String pwd, Model model) {\r\n        String encPwd = passwordEncoder.encode(pwd);              // 1. 암호화 (매번 다른 값)\r\n        model.addAttribute(&quot;encPwd&quot;, encPwd);\r\n        return &quot;pwd&quot;;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    @RequestMapping(value = &quot;/pwdCheck&quot;, method = RequestMethod.GET)\r\n    public String pwdCheck(String pwd, String encPwd, Model model) {\r\n        boolean ok = passwordEncoder.matches(pwd, encPwd);       // 2. 원본 vs 암호화 값 비교\r\n        model.addAttribute(&quot;flag&quot;, ok ? &quot;비밀번호 일치&quot; : &quot;비밀번호 X&quot;);\r\n        return &quot;pwd&quot;;\r\n    }\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">encode 결과는 같은 비밀번호라도 매번 다르다(salt) — 문자열 비교(equals)가 아니라 matches 로 확인</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/spring/security/bcrypt","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"spring","title":"SPRING","path":"it/syntax/spring"},{"id":"security","title":"Security · 인터셉터","path":"it/syntax/spring/security"}],"hasImage":false}